Shading and Lighting Functions:
-------------------------------

ambient				()			**DONE** Phase 3, gmanshaderenvironment.h **REACHABLE** env.ambient() -- sums every active GMAN_LIGHT_AMBIENT
diffuse				(normal)		**DONE** Phase 3, gmanshaderenvironment.h **REACHABLE** env.diffuse(n) -- sums Cl*max(0,N.L) over non-ambient lights
specular			(normal;vector;float)	**DONE** Phase 3, gmanshaderenvironment.h **REACHABLE** env.specular(n,v,roughness) -- Blinn-Phong, the common approximation to the RISpec's own integral
